<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-lw-step-6 paid-block-lw-step-6"><ul class="paid-block-lw-step-6__inner"><li class="paid-block-lw-step-6__li" style="border-color:#ece2cd;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-radius:0px"><div class="number" style="background-color:#635021;color:#fff;font-weight:700"><span>20分</span></div><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:#635021;border-width:0;border-style:none;aspect-ratio:400 / 300"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/br_care.webp" alt="" style="object-fit:cover"/></div><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#4a3c17;border-bottom-color:#635021;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid">見る</h3><p class="paid-block-lw-step-6__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#38342c">顔と、ドレスで出るところ（背中・腕・デコルテ）を見ます。触れるのはこの時間だけです。</p></div></li><li class="paid-block-lw-step-6__li" style="border-color:#ece2cd;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-radius:0px"><div class="number" style="background-color:#635021;color:#fff;font-weight:700"><span>30分</span></div><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:#635021;border-width:0;border-style:none;aspect-ratio:400 / 300"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/br_counsel.webp" alt="" style="object-fit:cover"/></div><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#4a3c17;border-bottom-color:#635021;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid">引く</h3><p class="paid-block-lw-step-6__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#38342c">式の日から逆算して、何をいつまでにするかを紙に引きます。当店に通わない前提の案も一緒に書きます。</p></div></li><li class="paid-block-lw-step-6__li" style="border-color:#ece2cd;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-radius:0px"><div class="number" style="background-color:#635021;color:#fff;font-weight:700"><span>10分</span></div><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:#635021;border-width:0;border-style:none;aspect-ratio:400 / 300"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/br_dress.webp" alt="" style="object-fit:cover"/></div><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#4a3c17;border-bottom-color:#635021;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid">渡す</h3><p class="paid-block-lw-step-6__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#38342c">その紙をお渡しして終わりです。お持ち帰りいただいて、彼やご家族と相談してからで結構です。</p></div></li></ul></div>
